window.EXAUD={"Please accept this small gift from our class.": "audio/cau/86e7a0b4e2454140.mp3", "Lan accepted the invitation, but Minh refused it.": "audio/cau/ac6f7b1f73f4208f.mp3", "Being late is not acceptable.": "audio/cau/8a3b1f0c015e9312.mp3", "Your answer is acceptable.": "audio/cau/d2e54ceeb4996328.mp3", "She got a letter of acceptance from the school.": "audio/cau/626c65e15c7204bc.mp3", "Acceptance of others is important.": "audio/cau/3707bfbecddfcd67.mp3", "'Kind' is an adjective that describes people.": "audio/cau/e79678700752e8de.mp3", "Find one adjective in this sentence: Lan is clever.": "audio/cau/543a075275273447.mp3", "Kind and friendly are adjectives.": "audio/cau/571da65dd4451319.mp3", "Find two adjectives in each sentence.": "audio/cau/e83a6ada9ad972af.mp3", "Mai and I are the same age.": "audio/cau/316c398f1dd9646f.mp3", "My grandma is aged 70, and she is healthy for her age.": "audio/cau/ce1f660f39560590.mp3", "The club is for children aged 10 to 12.": "audio/cau/07038bc4b6e8bf81.mp3", "Phong is aged 11, and at his age he loves football.": "audio/cau/43c9a4402e78da46.mp3", "I agree with you about the park.": "audio/cau/f2a726fc02481cb5.mp3", "Nam agrees with the plan, but Mi disagrees.": "audio/cau/15f7b23e7c7063cd.mp3", "We reached an agreement after the talk.": "audio/cau/1544b408c62fc15c.mp3", "She nodded in agreement.": "audio/cau/4c9349a25fbbf77c.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Mai answered all the questions in the quiz.": "audio/cau/c93d065e33503510.mp3", "Khoa answered \"Yes\" to question 3.": "audio/cau/0f875ac2987d5d20.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "I had an argument with my sister.": "audio/cau/3985d243607d6392.mp3", "His argument is very strong.": "audio/cau/fabb8432f3f23996.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "My school bag is very heavy.": "audio/cau/81c86f54e6817fa3.mp3", "Mi has a red bag, and Lan has two blue bags.": "audio/cau/33eb6b7417d04199.mp3", "Please use cloth bags instead of plastic bags.": "audio/cau/6e414fb5f6866be5.mp3", "This bag is old, so Mum bought two new bags.": "audio/cau/5c197b55387c41e0.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a World Heritage Site.": "audio/cau/5a085a89254963b8.mp3", "There are thousands of islands in the bay.": "audio/cau/4cf873f6cc8fd985.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "I believe you.": "audio/cau/c1b7bfc3adc01b41.mp3", "Do you believe in ghosts?": "audio/cau/83a7564931d63151.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "This is the biggest cake I have seen.": "audio/cau/c296bc3ae81de590.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "The children love bonbons.": "audio/cau/cef11e4ebfa0fecb.mp3", "She gave me a box of bonbons.": "audio/cau/a42acc664a431d0f.mp3", "The boy next to Mi is my brother.": "audio/cau/2b8e169ba1253282.mp3", "There are ten boys and twelve girls in my class.": "audio/cau/f109fb5b9db06caa.mp3", "My dad told me about his boyhood.": "audio/cau/07bbaf2f97aea1c8.mp3", "This is his boyhood home.": "audio/cau/290020f85e6dc306.mp3", "The boys are playing football in the yard.": "audio/cau/a14f1aea2e9181df.mp3", "One boy is reading, and the other boys are drawing.": "audio/cau/4ae5ad7c214a1d49.mp3", "Use the words in brackets.": "audio/cau/496e7371ea0c5719.mp3", "Put the verb in the bracket in the correct form.": "audio/cau/dab9456e755cf63f.mp3", "Put the verbs in brackets in the correct form.": "audio/cau/db94e0ded7cf0ad1.mp3", "Write the word in brackets, like this: (go).": "audio/cau/35267fe98d59e0cc.mp3", "My brother is ten years old.": "audio/cau/8117bffc8b9c9ebf.mp3", "Lan has two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/2a5491a08996a7e7.mp3", "My brother's bedroom is next to mine.": "audio/cau/f1b45b215b39838f.mp3", "This is my brother, and that is my brother's bike.": "audio/cau/22273538d6265be4.mp3", "Sport brings a sense of brotherhood.": "audio/cau/60ab616f45158de4.mp3", "The festival celebrates brotherhood.": "audio/cau/7eb183fc4d55f45d.mp3", "I have two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/40fabe17eb0c1d6b.mp3", "Minh's brothers are tall, but his sister is short.": "audio/cau/75d0c7461a54ce03.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "She answered calmly.": "audio/cau/c0bc67ad5450e5d5.mp3", "Walk out calmly when there is a fire.": "audio/cau/fad079b435374c70.mp3", "I admire his calmness.": "audio/cau/005245e1abe4ac55.mp3", "Yoga brings calmness.": "audio/cau/68f38a4c896ebb4a.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "My dad goes to work by car.": "audio/cau/9da1d69f2607f513.mp3", "There are more cars in the city than in the village.": "audio/cau/cff85749cb66c62f.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "There are too many cars on the road.": "audio/cau/af9e36fc967bfae5.mp3", "This car is new, but those cars are old.": "audio/cau/a9c38aadea83ed91.mp3", "There is a cat under the bed.": "audio/cau/b07c0b9bf36ecd88.mp3", "Our cat has two little kittens.": "audio/cau/faccccf3b8679bc0.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "My sister is very chatty.": "audio/cau/276b5f54d77e4429.mp3", "The chatty boy has many friends.": "audio/cau/40b44064047e81db.mp3", "Bus tickets are cheap in my city.": "audio/cau/03544a8cd417b99f.mp3", "This bike is cheaper than that expensive one.": "audio/cau/e0b002a616298d3f.mp3", "This shirt is cheaper than that one.": "audio/cau/2fb5e5af26848879.mp3", "Food at the market is cheaper.": "audio/cau/21368e59cd125059.mp3", "This is the cheapest bike in the shop.": "audio/cau/c9b3edafd0c21611.mp3", "The bus is the cheapest way to travel.": "audio/cau/0b549f6a33bccebd.mp3", "You can eat cheaply at street stalls.": "audio/cau/dfea060d3a66f8ee.mp3", "We travelled cheaply by bus.": "audio/cau/c965f95b5b8607df.mp3", "The baby has chubby cheeks.": "audio/cau/4d2de404c797ef95.mp3", "My brother was chubby, but now he is thin.": "audio/cau/744be57209c1189a.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "She answered the question cleverly.": "audio/cau/b127f7ca5556eeca.mp3", "The robot is cleverly designed.": "audio/cau/78c94fc4362f7380.mp3", "Everyone praised his cleverness.": "audio/cau/8a333324f6d5417b.mp3", "The fox is known for its cleverness.": "audio/cau/165b55f081837120.mp3", "The pencil is 15 cm long.": "audio/cau/9f3be1039db1c201.mp3", "I am 150 cm tall.": "audio/cau/ebf91635575b1372.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "It is colder in Hà Nội than in Huế.": "audio/cau/b237ef8ec896eeff.mp3", "Today is colder than yesterday.": "audio/cau/409448c6fcb45c6b.mp3", "January is the coldest month.": "audio/cau/ebe4d008920b3287.mp3", "Sa Pa is one of the coldest places in Việt Nam.": "audio/cau/8864f62bbf1c3b12.mp3", "I can feel the coldness of the water.": "audio/cau/23d48b220795c5bf.mp3", "Her coldness made him sad.": "audio/cau/681563c4a0ca6a61.mp3", "The comparative of 'big' is 'bigger'.": "audio/cau/4e28e78ae9e0c458.mp3", "We compare two cities using the comparative.": "audio/cau/928477415d139668.mp3", "Compare your answers with your partner.": "audio/cau/f8be7b0e308e141f.mp3", "Let's compare the two pictures and find the differences.": "audio/cau/d1518af4c2a94436.mp3", "Make a comparison between city and country life.": "audio/cau/4eb51db2fe33ea37.mp3", "We learn comparison of adjectives.": "audio/cau/02353122847ea89a.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "Travelling abroad is costly.": "audio/cau/3ecac6693c9b43a2.mp3", "The mistake was costly.": "audio/cau/02e469afe966b2c2.mp3", "A young couple lives next door.": "audio/cau/d0f20b42a6aca611.mp3", "Wait a couple of minutes.": "audio/cau/88b6985e0d22ec59.mp3", "Please cut the paper into small pieces.": "audio/cau/a1fd8b0ff53be3ae.mp3", "Yesterday Nam cut the cake for his friends.": "audio/cau/97279c7011b57f8b.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Daddy, can you read me a story?": "audio/cau/7b9c274b06183fb5.mp3", "My daddy works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/7cb12862406fc83e.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "The sky darkened before the storm.": "audio/cau/d9787ddc931beccb.mp3", "Darken the room to watch the film.": "audio/cau/8dcb0bff5658ca38.mp3", "The cat can see in the darkness.": "audio/cau/4ab111dd152c0904.mp3", "The room was in complete darkness.": "audio/cau/76f9e637b0656b52.mp3", "The Sahara is the largest hot desert.": "audio/cau/b5ab545ec1917b35.mp3", "Camels can live in the desert.": "audio/cau/c06453c4acef7e3c.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I disagree with your idea.": "audio/cau/7cce19c50dd76b38.mp3", "Nam agrees, but Lan disagrees with him.": "audio/cau/c54e8ccfbafa7323.mp3", "They had a disagreement about the trip.": "audio/cau/f1d5a16d4f41e479.mp3", "We sometimes disagree, but each disagreement is small.": "audio/cau/9bbbf8d89f966fd1.mp3", "I have a small dog.": "audio/cau/d418efa45ea78edf.mp3", "Our dog plays with our neighbour's puppy.": "audio/cau/fe69c388bd55c243.mp3", "This T-shirt costs ten dollars.": "audio/cau/971b1384b609b99a.mp3", "He saved fifty dollars for a new book.": "audio/cau/b3c227e182f0e05f.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "The soldiers fought the enemy bravely.": "audio/cau/d7e74b5bf24e5f1e.mp3", "The cat is the enemy of the mouse.": "audio/cau/9cbb92de9d0d7660.mp3", "Can you enlarge this photo?": "audio/cau/f7ea9d85d2ae68b7.mp3", "They plan to enlarge the school library.": "audio/cau/98d58917fdd12ccd.mp3", "Add er to make the comparative: dense becomes denser.": "audio/cau/80052b55c7afa240.mp3", "Dirty becomes dirtier: change y to i and add er.": "audio/cau/5c7897723129ca0f.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "I have a maths exam tomorrow.": "audio/cau/a057069f2c02c041.mp3", "Lan studied hard for the exam, and she passed the test.": "audio/cau/862ea18aaf0d9c06.mp3", "I passed the English examination.": "audio/cau/744545c9e2f8c394.mp3", "The doctor gave me a medical examination.": "audio/cau/5cad08bb0b921827.mp3", "The doctor examined my eyes.": "audio/cau/d70c7c7e8e2fd359.mp3", "Examine the picture and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/1d90e529cdb2d38f.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "Food is our biggest expense.": "audio/cau/25abb079ec0a7e72.mp3", "The school paid the expense of the trip.": "audio/cau/0af9eb98ee27b49b.mp3", "Houses in the city are expensive.": "audio/cau/53d09ce3370d8fca.mp3", "This bag is expensive, but that one is cheap.": "audio/cau/d708d9a2b5676f1d.mp3", "We went to the book fair on Sunday.": "audio/cau/3ffcbaf506dd881c.mp3", "It's not fair to cheat in a test.": "audio/cau/945f8b31052e1278.mp3", "Many families live in flats in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/0f99802cf5d0ebaf.mp3", "Families get together at Tet.": "audio/cau/60357c1a8fa848a4.mp3", "There are four people in my family.": "audio/cau/8324f70f7fed9e74.mp3", "Many families in my village grow rice.": "audio/cau/5b179b43939643fc.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "The metro is faster than the bus.": "audio/cau/283f49010d3fb77d.mp3", "Life in the city is fast, and it is getting faster.": "audio/cau/e265429bd738b871.mp3", "The cheetah is the fastest land animal.": "audio/cau/67ea05e6eb3c8296.mp3", "Nam is the fastest runner in our class.": "audio/cau/3af97ab0e10a4efe.mp3", "The fat cat is sleeping on the sofa.": "audio/cau/5021ae24bc6cb140.mp3", "Our dog was fat, but now it is thin.": "audio/cau/92f49810a517e8a7.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "I can't find my pencil.": "audio/cau/8c42ffdede29d976.mp3", "Lan lost her key, but Nam found it.": "audio/cau/59b8a65c0d818025.mp3", "Report your group's findings to the class.": "audio/cau/113b416e3511e60b.mp3", "Nam found some facts, and we shared our findings.": "audio/cau/fb2f3c17395a9325.mp3", "Mi finds city life exciting.": "audio/cau/43581944ff348c1f.mp3", "Minh finds maths easy, and he found the test easy too.": "audio/cau/aef390d81e1b78f5.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "She has a thousand followers online.": "audio/cau/23024d95c73edb6e.mp3", "He is a follower of the football team.": "audio/cau/d212f1f4123de65f.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "Write the correct form of the verb.": "audio/cau/704fc6fb85cc3f27.mp3", "'Going' is the -ing form of 'go'.": "audio/cau/8b6c34b2f8dd653a.mp3", "The cave has amazing rock formations.": "audio/cau/044cef15503b6f02.mp3", "We learnt about the formation of rain.": "audio/cau/69ef9163d5895073.mp3", "I found my keys under the bed.": "audio/cau/1c273538232b0b89.mp3", "They founded the school in 1995.": "audio/cau/f09f1d435ab96ceb.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Tourists love the friendliness of local people.": "audio/cau/a40be7352a7002db.mp3", "Her friendliness makes everyone happy.": "audio/cau/a90e79e9d7f1fffe.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "My brother is a serious gamer.": "audio/cau/7a29eee205c35813.mp3", "Gamers should take breaks to rest their eyes.": "audio/cau/714192b94227026f.mp3", "The girl in the red dress is my sister.": "audio/cau/5c0a090c7edf82c5.mp3", "There are fifteen girls and twenty boys in my class.": "audio/cau/6f902e1712b320f2.mp3", "The girls are playing badminton.": "audio/cau/52ee8ca04fd9a936.mp3", "One girl wears glasses, and the other girls don't.": "audio/cau/b79f88c94a17e5cf.mp3", "I'm glad to see you again.": "audio/cau/2142ed8602d3048a.mp3", "She was glad about her good marks.": "audio/cau/d16fb4cab4382d01.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "My grandma tells us stories every night.": "audio/cau/96809300e183923c.mp3", "Grandma and Grandpa live with us.": "audio/cau/8051252f03d98b36.mp3", "My grandmother makes conical hats by hand.": "audio/cau/fb6599cb79d9916d.mp3", "Lan calls her grandmother 'Grandma'.": "audio/cau/61992d8dfda62651.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/14d9858e971da542.mp3", "Minh visits his grandparents; his grandfather has a farm.": "audio/cau/ff809b7d116e870e.mp3", "Granny tells me stories every night.": "audio/cau/e5e7ca2e8b433e14.mp3", "I visit my granny on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b2eaecf09b65cf7d.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "It was the happiest day of my life.": "audio/cau/6048467774b371d1.mp3", "Nam is the happiest boy in our class.": "audio/cau/b5233b9378eb9841.mp3", "The children are playing happily in the yard.": "audio/cau/16909a238549ea96.mp3", "She smiled happily at her teacher.": "audio/cau/4b9815868c8e0707.mp3", "Good health brings happiness.": "audio/cau/d40ad946903ff046.mp3", "Her face was full of happiness.": "audio/cau/cf704e43df3396fb.mp3", "I am happy to see my friends again.": "audio/cau/29fdd3b9f6ed1e66.mp3", "Mi smiles happily because she is happy.": "audio/cau/feee63efb252ba2b.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "We turn on the heater in winter.": "audio/cau/97b6d2a218e566ca.mp3", "The water heater is broken.": "audio/cau/3923709391d2f3ac.mp3", "This is the heaviest bag in the room.": "audio/cau/df2cf2866352878d.mp3", "The elephant is the heaviest land animal.": "audio/cau/0023e4778fdcfdae.mp3", "It rained heavily last night.": "audio/cau/1a3ae2881e3af6a8.mp3", "The city is heavily polluted.": "audio/cau/30feb15789eaf8ce.mp3", "I felt a heaviness in my legs after the run.": "audio/cau/93a252fa650203da.mp3", "The heaviness of the box surprised me.": "audio/cau/41712f1b0642aa07.mp3", "This box is too heavy for me.": "audio/cau/ac63962a8602519b.mp3", "Heavy rain causes floods, and the traffic gets heavier.": "audio/cau/7da989b969861a4f.mp3", "My height is one metre fifty.": "audio/cau/6ed0620c69bbaf2a.mp3", "The tower is very high; its height is 100 metres.": "audio/cau/3baba19856abae04.mp3", "The campaign heightens awareness of pollution.": "audio/cau/56be7ae049bd5030.mp3", "Music can heighten your mood.": "audio/cau/6b33e5d565f0fa6e.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "The cat hid under the bed.": "audio/cau/298f285710fac644.mp3", "I hid the present in my bag.": "audio/cau/07440e0df31ca254.mp3", "Let's play hide-and-seek!": "audio/cau/92bdf95ba8e2006c.mp3", "Where did you hide the key?": "audio/cau/353d0b3791179764.mp3", "The sky train runs high above the ground.": "audio/cau/8dbedccf6d7409b7.mp3", "Birds fly high in the sky.": "audio/cau/b0c96ceb3c271f43.mp3", "This book is highly interesting.": "audio/cau/009ba70280cc0bc3.mp3", "I highly recommend this film.": "audio/cau/da2440ac003a9db6.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "I felt homesick on my first day at camp.": "audio/cau/4d3a402933ae59e2.mp3", "Students studying abroad often feel homesick.": "audio/cau/ea48648e9a7d5f77.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is hotter than Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/88067063f0f080f3.mp3", "July is hot, but this week is even hotter.": "audio/cau/665ec33e8beb3794.mp3", "July is the hottest month of the year here.": "audio/cau/fe0ba3253dbf0bf9.mp3", "Today is hot, but tomorrow will be the hottest day.": "audio/cau/49fb3f5586c59a2b.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "Early ends in y, so we add ier: earlier.": "audio/cau/756e5a20d686dfbc.mp3", "The city is busier and noisier than my village.": "audio/cau/80f36cf206ff95d7.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Please inform your parents about the trip.": "audio/cau/13aeeaab5b16b406.mp3", "The radio informs us about the weather.": "audio/cau/11a03146fba546fa.mp3", "Read the information about the summer camp.": "audio/cau/79656cd9cf078d89.mp3", "Our teacher informs us and gives us useful information.": "audio/cau/91b87a5117185e7b.mp3", "This TV programme is very informative.": "audio/cau/8bc42a012462e39b.mp3", "The museum guide was informative.": "audio/cau/3690ade728312b48.mp3", "Dolphins are intelligent animals.": "audio/cau/ff347eccc7ca9ffd.mp3", "She is an intelligent student.": "audio/cau/3510c8cda7bcca9d.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Nam isn't at home now.": "audio/cau/064ea182a69f9ba0.mp3", "This is my bag, but that one isn't.": "audio/cau/93f1c4d3918a4422.mp3", "The journey to Sa Pa takes six hours.": "audio/cau/f3e4b822504fb7f1.mp3", "Have a safe journey!": "audio/cau/5af9e1ac6fbaf195.mp3", "The children jumped with joy.": "audio/cau/25a28f51bcf50f60.mp3", "Music brings joy to people.": "audio/cau/a37e5e6bd506c6c2.mp3", "Minh finished his project just before the due date.": "audio/cau/6a8c8ece8bd3699e.mp3", "Hoa arrived just before the test started.": "audio/cau/ddc502e35be5489a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "I weigh 40 kg.": "audio/cau/07c76b9aa091f54c.mp3", "Buy 2 kg of rice, please.": "audio/cau/36934d004e807b87.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "She smiled kindly at me.": "audio/cau/1f6770a4e642e4ad.mp3", "He kindly helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/355561eff4531966.mp3", "Thank you for your kindness.": "audio/cau/5a1909574805c9b6.mp3", "Small acts of kindness make people happy.": "audio/cau/591eeb7107114f71.mp3", "Our cat has three kittens.": "audio/cau/d7438ba330ccfbce.mp3", "The kitten is playing with a ball.": "audio/cau/bd37be5a6206990f.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "There is a lamp on my desk.": "audio/cau/80d55c1669ed8758.mp3", "Turn on the lamp; the light is too weak.": "audio/cau/19093375e9e548a3.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "The town is largely quiet at night.": "audio/cau/6acff2f7d5971d4e.mp3", "Our success is largely due to teamwork.": "audio/cau/f39589c55d704f4b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is larger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/34248d77fe6d06a4.mp3", "Ha Noi is large, but Ho Chi Minh City is larger.": "audio/cau/8d6bb314d8a84f29.mp3", "Son Doong is the largest cave in the world.": "audio/cau/e24701bf03dbe79b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the largest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/846e9ffebe286bac.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "The guide will lead us to the cave.": "audio/cau/fec30eb491d4e7ec.mp3", "Eating too much sugar can lead to health problems.": "audio/cau/feb456adaea6d50e.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Describe your hair by its length and colour.": "audio/cau/ad23f44edd907020.mp3", "The length of the table is two metres; it's long.": "audio/cau/84f01bf78c674bd1.mp3", "Can you lengthen this skirt?": "audio/cau/0a5c035ab48364ca.mp3", "The days lengthen in summer.": "audio/cau/dbde970d0e6e0b9c.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "This is the lightest laptop in the shop.": "audio/cau/4e1b9050c303b263.mp3", "Feathers are the lightest things in the box.": "audio/cau/da3073815927918f.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "The Mekong is a very long river.": "audio/cau/962b2d2abaecb121.mp3", "Mi has long hair, but Lan has short hair.": "audio/cau/21e34cbfd1358b0e.mp3", "The Mekong River is longer than the Red River.": "audio/cau/905b796144fca18b.mp3", "My hair is long, but Lan's hair is longer.": "audio/cau/42b8b83aaee9331e.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Nam looked at the old photos of his village.": "audio/cau/57a1a25de6c14b73.mp3", "She looked tired yesterday, but today she looks happy.": "audio/cau/72e5fb4099eea871.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Some villages may lose their traditional crafts.": "audio/cau/bce588b5a80d185a.mp3", "Don't lose your key; I lost mine last week.": "audio/cau/828561b9bfd1a13e.mp3", "The loser shook hands with the winner.": "audio/cau/1be1845c7ef5dd94.mp3", "Don't be a bad loser.": "audio/cau/0dd12f964b5c6872.mp3", "With a plan, Lan is never at a loss with too much work.": "audio/cau/bb851d51c8b95d7d.mp3", "Nam was at a loss when all his tests came at once.": "audio/cau/8f5192fc719bd367.mp3", "I lost my pen yesterday.": "audio/cau/23e62d5295ebade9.mp3", "We got lost in the old town.": "audio/cau/78a43d0df814944e.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "Don't talk loudly in the library.": "audio/cau/6950de8c7d7445c9.mp3", "The baby cried loudly at night.": "audio/cau/7da69b2aed82f71b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "The price of this book is low.": "audio/cau/0a550bb977c74722.mp3", "The wall is very low.": "audio/cau/e9866ca6574d7e65.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "People here mainly grow rice.": "audio/cau/39ba45d7f9277780.mp3", "I mainly use my phone for study.": "audio/cau/7e14d886ebe6707d.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Please don't misunderstand me.": "audio/cau/913575a433273816.mp3", "People often misunderstand this word.": "audio/cau/d26a103ea1d3f9ec.mp3", "Read the model story first.": "audio/cau/96d5d11b4bc02327.mp3", "My father is my role model.": "audio/cau/d6cd0d28b863f1d8.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "My family will move to Da Nang next year.": "audio/cau/52a8b01da231ec79.mp3", "We moved to a new flat, and we don't want to move again.": "audio/cau/1f00cc6fb33d58c8.mp3", "Nam's family moved to the city last year.": "audio/cau/c585b20f0e51b8dc.mp3", "We moved to Hue, but we may move again soon.": "audio/cau/a9a10be2c45962d4.mp3", "Dancing needs fast movement.": "audio/cau/9a664a2d00ce92c8.mp3", "Our school joins the Green Movement.": "audio/cau/c60e5122169e11a9.mp3", "Moving to a new city can be hard.": "audio/cau/2fa286a0802dcc57.mp3", "They are moving to Ha Noi because they want to move near work.": "audio/cau/7d2136ef12f1a387.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "My phone is newer than yours.": "audio/cau/b9582550ab411283.mp3", "This building is newer.": "audio/cau/94018b78e01f455f.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "This is the nicest park in town.": "audio/cau/19fb4537482c7de0.mp3", "She is the nicest girl in my class.": "audio/cau/cb9a504bf77858dd.mp3", "Please ask nicely.": "audio/cau/44ab037cea553fcf.mp3", "The room is nicely decorated.": "audio/cau/6eb8998173f66908.mp3", "He is the nicest person I know.": "audio/cau/e8560886a2e90b40.mp3", "This is the nicest beach in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/fdf01e5a85936ccb.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "This is the noisiest street in town.": "audio/cau/2623da283d661306.mp3", "Our class is the noisiest one.": "audio/cau/efd17de1c5f18d12.mp3", "The children played noisily.": "audio/cau/91ef21d722603a6c.mp3", "Don't eat noisily.": "audio/cau/47c9f7f3b63e2c3f.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "The verb 'do' needs an object.": "audio/cau/39d543adf72c24e9.mp3", "In 'I love music', 'music' is the object.": "audio/cau/695391fd78ce8c91.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "This is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/112d241056ccf384.mp3", "My grandpa is the oldest in my family.": "audio/cau/9f9847641a26a88e.mp3", "There is only one bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/000e91b12face3a4.mp3", "Lan is an only child; she has just one cousin.": "audio/cau/b6ec9a93c21bdf30.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "Eating too much sugar can make you overweight.": "audio/cau/9df60b1ba5192e48.mp3", "My cat is a bit overweight.": "audio/cau/1f030b1da6ac37b8.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "Use the words in parentheses.": "audio/cau/c654b42b83e8fb4f.mp3", "Put the verbs in parentheses in the correct form.": "audio/cau/5c76924820458187.mp3", "My parents are always kind and patient.": "audio/cau/f70296736693e0b8.mp3", "My dad is a busy parent, but my parents always eat dinner with us.": "audio/cau/02cfa7df92c1de83.mp3", "It will be partly cloudy tomorrow.": "audio/cau/2e9279ced890cd59.mp3", "The story is partly true.": "audio/cau/a56a321d8dcb3386.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "Our school has a partnership with a school in Japan.": "audio/cau/94480f1a5b1a2bf9.mp3", "Good partnership makes good results.": "audio/cau/6f55e8eb690f4709.mp3", "Everyone wants peace in the world.": "audio/cau/7491ecb0cd9d5164.mp3", "I like the peace of the countryside.": "audio/cau/1a9d1d69992b48c6.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "The baby is sleeping peacefully.": "audio/cau/eb86ccf5ad0e8214.mp3", "People live peacefully in the village.": "audio/cau/c22dbd799ffc67fb.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Hoa has a friendly personality.": "audio/cau/5e968c0ca289e9bb.mp3", "Minh has a strong character and a kind personality.": "audio/cau/e35df7bcc2cd6179.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "We went to Da Nang by plane.": "audio/cau/63039d0916892fcd.mp3", "The plane is in the sky.": "audio/cau/4869873b1647ae5a.mp3", "We had a pleasant day at the craft village.": "audio/cau/e1f0b1cdb0d3b469.mp3", "The weather is pleasant today, not unpleasant like yesterday.": "audio/cau/d39fb3e0aac88724.mp3", "I'm pleased to meet you.": "audio/cau/f7277017f0c93fd1.mp3", "The teacher is pleased with our work.": "audio/cau/ef3a88639bfe5e25.mp3", "It's a pleasure to talk to you.": "audio/cau/eff2f68747b92dda.mp3", "Reading gives my grandmother a lot of pleasure.": "audio/cau/09e7f994211010c0.mp3", "The baby has plump cheeks.": "audio/cau/4b2e1bda6e1c1cf9.mp3", "My cat is a little plump.": "audio/cau/504e4315b487d531.mp3", "This is a powerful computer.": "audio/cau/85ae80d24de8ae8c.mp3", "The storm was very powerful.": "audio/cau/6a353ad61142eb6b.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "She is a TV presenter.": "audio/cau/12a3eb4b246723e1.mp3", "The presenter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/cf8a5c5982b7bec0.mp3", "Look at the previous page.": "audio/cau/5236de3455b3c630.mp3", "I met her the previous day.": "audio/cau/209d74f5321dec53.mp3", "What is the price of this book?": "audio/cau/8077f94f42e8b72e.mp3", "The price is too high.": "audio/cau/283a62cf03cde6ba.mp3", "I got a puppy for my birthday.": "audio/cau/0f9410e8f7c95b14.mp3", "The puppy is playing with a ball.": "audio/cau/9d756468bb5546bd.mp3", "Put your books on the desk.": "audio/cau/2d454633026296cc.mp3", "Yesterday I put my bike in the garage.": "audio/cau/4337fe6ef9062f07.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "The bus is quicker than walking.": "audio/cau/fd78b06ad1b32825.mp3", "Is there a quicker way?": "audio/cau/79a67fa0b1d684ae.mp3", "She quickly became famous.": "audio/cau/69d2407f5c23a407.mp3", "Minh walks quickly, but his brother walks slowly.": "audio/cau/df1476232b08c52c.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "This is the quietest room in the house.": "audio/cau/11600b6ece141722.mp3", "He is the quietest boy in my class.": "audio/cau/783a350ac7335e76.mp3", "Please speak quietly in the library.": "audio/cau/d3d8ecfcd2451005.mp3", "She closed the door quietly.": "audio/cau/ca20754f99efde5b.mp3", "I love the quietness of the countryside.": "audio/cau/13091db4624edf0a.mp3", "The quietness helped me study.": "audio/cau/b9d1231d026f5544.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "It's OK to refuse help politely.": "audio/cau/ecf4198cfd3d8fed.mp3", "Mi accepted the invitation, but Nam refused it.": "audio/cau/103ce51e84177e62.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "This robot can help people clean the house.": "audio/cau/abb1c1ffc510fec1.mp3", "Nam has a robot and many other robotic toys.": "audio/cau/180c8c82c4eb569d.mp3", "We saw a robotic arm in the factory.": "audio/cau/0faecff22a0186d3.mp3", "His voice sounds robotic.": "audio/cau/690d793dfc5c09b0.mp3", "My brother joined the robotics club.": "audio/cau/ac3208f1ad0effa3.mp3", "Robotics is growing fast.": "audio/cau/1535ff89b36cc8b0.mp3", "Robots may cook and clean for us one day.": "audio/cau/fa7e5831327603d0.mp3", "Our school robot can answer simple questions.": "audio/cau/a35f70868eedba43.mp3", "My room is small but very tidy.": "audio/cau/bd9658dea75a069a.mp3", "There are five rooms in my house.": "audio/cau/a28138f93ee20867.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I feel sad when it rains.": "audio/cau/eb933f7742f31790.mp3", "It's a sad story.": "audio/cau/609036f450dba425.mp3", "Her eyes were full of sadness.": "audio/cau/c859a19efbe96ee4.mp3", "Music can help with sadness.": "audio/cau/ce070d4025e717bf.mp3", "I said, can you pass me the book?": "audio/cau/e2db7c41d720581d.mp3", "The teacher said we should sleep early.": "audio/cau/f9528b768b823292.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "What is the artisan saying about his work?": "audio/cau/758a63f41cdaea82.mp3", "Grandpa said an old saying about hard work.": "audio/cau/dae1465b6bed02a4.mp3", "Lan is my schoolmate, not my classmate.": "audio/cau/e2d3147caa8ce83b.mp3", "I met a schoolmate at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/600fe95b9cf0ba63.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "The shopper paid with her phone.": "audio/cau/82693d164cb86375.mp3", "A smart shopper compares prices first.": "audio/cau/b7f5abffe4fe148b.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "My brother is short, but he plays basketball well.": "audio/cau/d8ddf117afef7434.mp3", "Minh is tall, but his brother is short.": "audio/cau/fa281035bc257ead.mp3", "Please shorten your report to one page.": "audio/cau/dee63c16ae986ee6.mp3", "The story is too long, so make it short.": "audio/cau/b95346b6a813da23.mp3", "Make your talk shorter and clearer.": "audio/cau/fee387daa9baa55d.mp3", "My hair is short, but Lan's is shorter.": "audio/cau/df9914fe5566375f.mp3", "Lan is the shortest girl in my class.": "audio/cau/4869decaf5fe63bb.mp3", "This is the shortest way to school.": "audio/cau/1165d250c81d2661.mp3", "Shortly after that, he moved to Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/11ea9cd1ebe627ae.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so wait here.": "audio/cau/c03ac79a596be37a.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The artisan showed us how to make lanterns.": "audio/cau/897188b380de15ca.mp3", "Please show me too; you showed Mi yesterday.": "audio/cau/f493ef15d21acfbb.mp3", "The film is shown on TV tonight.": "audio/cau/75e35008646b299e.mp3", "She has shown me her new room.": "audio/cau/d93aaba1ebaa7897.mp3", "Please work in silence during the test.": "audio/cau/a7f626c54a6524f3.mp3", "There was silence in the room.": "audio/cau/809df2d322bd51e7.mp3", "My sister is kind and very funny.": "audio/cau/682ebfe0aa138164.mp3", "I have one sister and two brothers.": "audio/cau/14c3dc4d63096025.mp3", "My sister is tall and slim.": "audio/cau/ae9d629687e345be.mp3", "Mi is slim, but she isn't too thin.": "audio/cau/b60ca5ae77435297.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "Buses are slower than the skytrain.": "audio/cau/8a5cf809dbe2bb1c.mp3", "My bike is slow, but Nam's bike is slower.": "audio/cau/5f310889d995fb21.mp3", "Please speak slowly so I can understand.": "audio/cau/68b132e808a46997.mp3", "The old man walked slowly to the bus stop.": "audio/cau/87e81f4cf164cdf1.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "My village is smaller than the city.": "audio/cau/77ad0931648736fe.mp3", "This shop is small, but that one is even smaller.": "audio/cau/0d67ec98fa2886f3.mp3", "This is the smallest room in the house.": "audio/cau/be5f404374212531.mp3", "Vatican City is the smallest country in the world.": "audio/cau/df407ba4f28abf48.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "Smart phones are getting smarter every year.": "audio/cau/1906e5b64918106d.mp3", "Study hard and you will become smarter.": "audio/cau/3b92909dbc0c5ac9.mp3", "Minh is the smartest student in our class.": "audio/cau/52f9419a66ab2dc0.mp3", "This is the smartest robot I've ever seen.": "audio/cau/85227846dad7eace.mp3", "He was smartly dressed for the party.": "audio/cau/88e290727a0dd91d.mp3", "She smartly solved the problem.": "audio/cau/7e41ccd8721cc114.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "See you soon at school, Mi!": "audio/cau/fec53904fbd07d51.mp3", "The bus will arrive shortly, so we'll be home soon.": "audio/cau/b92c6bf10bdd4a35.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "My phone doesn't have enough storage.": "audio/cau/3a5f01cbd2fd8f6f.mp3", "We use the attic for storage.": "audio/cau/b6d76a321b8d9aee.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "You need strength to lift this box.": "audio/cau/3dbbf834979fca6e.mp3", "Patience is her greatest strength.": "audio/cau/3aa59f2197df2571.mp3", "Exercise strengthens your body.": "audio/cau/9dbdd04fb9ceff86.mp3", "Group work strengthens friendship.": "audio/cau/ce2040e852487065.mp3", "The people in my village have strong ties.": "audio/cau/820ea51c66a51b95.mp3", "Phong is strong, but his little brother is weak.": "audio/cau/73e0a188067b76d4.mp3", "He is the strongest boy in our class.": "audio/cau/0633159368caf5f2.mp3", "The elephant is one of the strongest animals.": "audio/cau/8aa69f278b73b827.mp3", "I strongly agree with you.": "audio/cau/2f823f9ce66857f6.mp3", "The wind was blowing strongly.": "audio/cau/5845f28dcfb6a05b.mp3", "It was stupid to go out in the storm.": "audio/cau/0351acace7c0b0e1.mp3", "Don't call your friends stupid.": "audio/cau/990524047e4281cb.mp3", "'Tallest' is the superlative of 'tall'.": "audio/cau/077d729f47509445.mp3", "Use superlatives to compare three or more things.": "audio/cau/cc694720ea2987a3.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "My father is very tall.": "audio/cau/fbbb73825cd6c0b9.mp3", "Minh is tall, but Phong is short.": "audio/cau/dc16694351cdb299.mp3", "The buildings in Ha Noi are taller now.": "audio/cau/3a6a0cd69acf2f3a.mp3", "Nam is taller than Minh, but Phong is the tallest.": "audio/cau/c467e4ad517a481a.mp3", "Nam is the tallest boy in my class.": "audio/cau/eec872ddb478ee49.mp3", "Landmark 81 is the tallest building in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/9c1caae0c8f0a625.mp3", "We have an English test on Friday.": "audio/cau/fa069b3f4f2546b7.mp3", "The teacher will test us before the big exam.": "audio/cau/531cece58d912518.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "The little cat is very thin.": "audio/cau/8c1ed6a4edac2bf8.mp3", "Lan is thin, but her little brother is chubby.": "audio/cau/06ddcea82b187e52.mp3", "The most important thing is to be honest.": "audio/cau/c302c847e8e66725.mp3", "Something is wrong; one thing is missing from my bag.": "audio/cau/c14d87bcc3d6fc9b.mp3", "I put my things in my schoolbag.": "audio/cau/bf35bafff88418e4.mp3", "There are many good things at my school, not just one thing.": "audio/cau/26ddc5ba45fd5524.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "He is a creative thinker.": "audio/cau/f59f27869620f000.mp3", "Confucius was a great thinker.": "audio/cau/e0d23762cc277705.mp3", "Thirdly, we should save water.": "audio/cau/a368bc621a56c1a0.mp3", "Thirdly, exercise keeps you healthy.": "audio/cau/5e62888bdcf24d9a.mp3", "That's a good thought!": "audio/cau/4c84ec15bb96b916.mp3", "I thought the test was easy.": "audio/cau/164ed73b13b1af06.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "My room is tidier than my brother's.": "audio/cau/507e8fce20e71980.mp3", "Please make your desk tidier.": "audio/cau/9a42cad256ce5463.mp3", "She put her books tidily on the shelf.": "audio/cau/9ee57a50c695c12c.mp3", "Please fold your clothes tidily.": "audio/cau/6c0ec0438609888f.mp3", "Hoa helps her mum tidy the house every weekend.": "audio/cau/75ef93fb6a1caa12.mp3", "Please tidy your desk before you go out, Nam.": "audio/cau/45374a843a380a3a.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "An elephant can weigh five tons.": "audio/cau/658a91b899a792fe.mp3", "The truck carries two tons of rice.": "audio/cau/5db2ec40c9f9dd9e.mp3", "We have tons of homework this week.": "audio/cau/fb10e48b972ec591.mp3", "There are tons of things to do, so we have lots of fun.": "audio/cau/796bfb181ecc10d3.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "We went on a tour of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/b1aef3993b1d87cd.mp3", "The bus tour starts at 8 a.m.": "audio/cau/dd11943cd2068c0b.mp3", "I want to travel around Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/0750a29d21b5efe2.mp3", "He travelled a lot; he was a real traveller.": "audio/cau/4dcdae3874eeaed4.mp3", "My grandfather travelled to many countries.": "audio/cau/107d8288b9a40c84.mp3", "She loves to travel and travelled to Sa Pa last year.": "audio/cau/93e220e8766f6d22.mp3", "She is an experienced traveller.": "audio/cau/29eb7abc2f370ce9.mp3", "The traveller asked me the way to the station.": "audio/cau/1fa099e8b22dabff.mp3", "We were travelling in Sa Pa when it started to rain.": "audio/cau/24e5da22d18fc04f.mp3", "Travelling helps us learn about new places.": "audio/cau/949a1cf0c4bf897c.mp3", "Bullying is unacceptable.": "audio/cau/592a33bec5fd4192.mp3", "Your behaviour is unacceptable.": "audio/cau/032ef3a6ad4e0065.mp3", "Do you understand the question, Hoa?": "audio/cau/4aad582adc859dab.mp3", "Minh understood the lesson, but Lan didn't understand it.": "audio/cau/d720b04327d8be8a.mp3", "I understood the lesson well.": "audio/cau/1d67b1ee5c74135b.mp3", "Have you understood the question?": "audio/cau/a1e59e5170364849.mp3", "The doctor said the child was underweight.": "audio/cau/db4b3f565c078088.mp3", "Eating too little can make you underweight.": "audio/cau/9283cb92ebb4155e.mp3", "The new neighbour seems unfriendly.": "audio/cau/0e1c5a5441788b1d.mp3", "Don't be unfriendly to new classmates.": "audio/cau/6506d305aef12ce1.mp3", "Loneliness can cause unhappiness.": "audio/cau/da585a08ee762949.mp3", "She hid her unhappiness from her friends.": "audio/cau/72c710e641ba4864.mp3", "People are unhappy with the traffic jams.": "audio/cau/8f666d0d974f8f0e.mp3", "Lan was unhappy yesterday, but today she is happy.": "audio/cau/79b51e0a7de4a479.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "My brother's room is always untidy.": "audio/cau/2d24a6095b534da2.mp3", "Don't leave your desk untidy.": "audio/cau/707b44454d306742.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "Spend your free time usefully.": "audio/cau/a5f343473daf5755.mp3", "Old bottles can be used usefully as pots.": "audio/cau/f80325fc53a6f5a0.mp3", "We talked about the usefulness of the Internet.": "audio/cau/1fa0f0d5fcdf7de1.mp3", "The usefulness of this tool is clear.": "audio/cau/a1f35dfbac0c1e29.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "It's warm today.": "audio/cau/cc0e8ca9006d57a2.mp3", "Wear a warm coat in winter.": "audio/cau/95aec6c826de01b5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "I felt weak after being ill.": "audio/cau/03f5f5db8d630661.mp3", "He is weak at Maths.": "audio/cau/c35e774616850489.mp3", "How much do you weigh?": "audio/cau/acb4bf07d5223766.mp3", "The shop assistant weighed the apples.": "audio/cau/4e7e5eaa540ad241.mp3", "If you eat too much fast food, you may put on more weight.": "audio/cau/2c99f39229f37ace.mp3", "Lan wants to lose weight, so she does more exercise.": "audio/cau/91285fa6cb6fd1e4.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Our team wants to win the match.": "audio/cau/e4c8afddb9e42c21.mp3", "Hoa won the prize, so she is the winner.": "audio/cau/2b49a5f49f82a8d5.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "The school has a yearly sports day.": "audio/cau/750d62eaf703f585.mp3", "We have a yearly health check.": "audio/cau/4c5595be96ba759a.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3", "I'm the youngest in my family.": "audio/cau/2b5949097bc49b2c.mp3", "She is the youngest student in the class.": "audio/cau/3af170b5e214d1ff.mp3", "My grandpa often talks about his youth.": "audio/cau/2cc4847b1b21067b.mp3", "The youth club meets on Saturdays.": "audio/cau/b613598b5b961ed0.mp3"};
